{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44926","headline":"小雪 · 无可","name":"小雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片片互玲珑，飞扬玉漏终。\n乍微全满地，渐密更无风。\n集物圆方别，连云远近同。\n作膏凝瘠土，呈瑞下深宫。\n气射重衣透，花窥小隙通。\n飘秦增旧岭，发汉揽长空。\n迥冒巢松鹤，孤鸣穴岛虫。\n过三知腊尽，盈尺贺年丰。\n委积休闻竹，稀疎渐见鸿。\n盖沙资澶漫，洒海助冲融。\n草木潜加润，山河更益雄。\n因知天地力，覆育有全功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}